<p class="note">"Last year: 30 · P10 days" is the count of days in the last 12 months at or under 30, then under the name's own three-year 10th percentile. The next four columns are the last three years, in days and episodes. "P10 above / below 200-day" is the name's all-history 10th-percentile RSI on days above its 200-day and on days below it.</p>

