<h2 id="template">3 · The morning read — one page the system fills before each discussion</h2>
<p>Filled once, for Monday 28 September, from Friday's finished bars and Sunday's live reads at {{CAPTURED}}. Every line names its source, its sample and the studies that feed it. The two operator inputs are named, dated and carry reasons. They stay empty until Alan sets them: the system never sets them itself.</p>

<div class="card" id="line1"><div class="line-h"><span class="tag">line 1</span><h4>The heat and its voters</h4><span class="tag">live · allocation.scintillahub.ai</span></div>
<p><b>{{HEAT_SENT}}</b> Heat {{HEAT_V}} on a −1 (washed out) to +1 (stretched) scale. Recomputed here from the {{VOTERS_N}} voters and weights as served: {{HEAT_R}}. {{VOTERS_ABST}} voters carry no weight or abstain.</p>
