<h2 id="priority">4 · The first ten for the quant loop, and what each needs</h2>
<p>These come first because they answer what Alan asked this week, because six have data in hand, and because each one unlocks others. Every result needs the loop's discipline: discover on 2003–2016, confirm on 2017–2026, a block bootstrap, and dead rules kept on the page.</p>
